      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR FREEDOM (5) hit the frame two on end before getting off the mark with a deserved win last time, scoring at this track over 407m (23.83). Has hit winning form and can go on with it. CANYA INVINCIBLE (1) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 1.75 lengths, (24.17) at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Expected to be in the finish again. SAY MORE WORDS (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (24.68) in a Grade 6 at this track. Cannot be taken lightly. FARMOR SURELY (7) is worth some thought after being close-up last start.",
